---
import Layout from '@layouts/Default.astro';

import MetaData from '@components/MetaData.astro';
import WavingHand from "@components/WavingHand.astro";
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---



<Layout>

  <MetaData slot="head:metadata" />

  <div class="about">
    <h1>Hi! I'm <span class="text-color-lemonade">lemon</span>. <WavingHand /></h1>
    <p>I work in communications, social media, and press relations — basically, I teach organizations how to sound human in a world run by algorithms. On the side, I still code, design, and contribute to open-source stuff like Catppuccin. It's been 15 years and somehow I haven't been banned from GitHub yet.</p>
    <p>My roots are in design — trained in both print and online media. Now I straddle that line: frontends, automation, servers, cybersecurity, and occasionally remembering to back things up. </p>
    <p>Off-screen, I recharge with books, nature walks, and League of Legends. (Top 1% Support Player — according to League of Graphs)</p>
    <p>Clarity in complexity—that's the goal. Whether it's copy or code, I'm here to make it make sense.</p>

    <ul class="social-links">
      <li><a href="https://catppuccin.com"><Icon name="ph:paw-print-duotone"/>Catppuccin</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/unseen-ninja"><Icon name="ph:github-logo-duotone"/>GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://nerdculture.de/@unseendotninja"><Icon name="ph:mastodon-logo-duotone"/>Mastodon</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</Layout>



<style lang="scss">
  :global(main) {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.6em;
    margin: 0; padding: 0;
    list-style: none;

    a {
      display: flex; gap: .4ch;
      align-items: center;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    [data-icon] {
      font-size: 120%;
    }
  }
</style>
